{"ID":"20240220132627-bjmbwc9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132627-bjmbwc9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132627-bjmbwc9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163510-ip45pts\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163510-r17jh5d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163510-r17jh5d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:120,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:120\u0026#125;","title":"【桂苓甘草龙骨牡蛎汤方】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312163510-ip45pts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-ip45pts","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百三十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-sm27is1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-sm27is1","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：火逆,烧针汗之,因烦躁者,「桂苓甘草龙骨牡蛎汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-fn9es3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-fn9es3f","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂苓甘草龙骨牡蛎汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-9otxrqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-9otxrqp","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝一两，甘草二两，牡蛎二两，龙骨二两，茯苓四两。右五味为末,以水五升,煮取二升半,去滓,温服八合,日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-wl6wp3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-wl6wp3m","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝、甘草，前面介绍过，动悸的时候我们会使用。茯苓脐下有动悸的时候我们会使用。临床上甲状腺，我们用这个处方做加减。甲状腺亢进，心动悸会很厉害，同时会潮热。用这个处方来做加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-p54rsk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-p54rsk7","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在病人出现烦躁的时候，张仲景都喜欢用茯苓。茯苓不单单是色白入肺，它入脾脏、利水。茯苓能够生津液。所以脐下悸我们用茯苓，因为茯苓能够把旧水排掉新水补回来。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-38ac8to","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-38ac8to","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果是火劫，发汗，病人津液伤到了，已经伤到津液的时候，我们重用茯苓。病人会烦躁，这种烦躁，除了大便便秘有烦躁，那个烦躁实际上是惊狂，有点谵语。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-gjzkld9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-gjzkld9","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个汤剂里面，可以看到，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝在治烦躁的时候，茯苓可以把心脏血里面水分补回去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们常常用到茯苓。临床用甲状腺来治疗甲状腺很有道理，牡蛎本身是海里面东西，有碘在里面，牡蛎可以攻坚，同时牡蛎又可以生津液，盗汗的时候可以用牡蛎。喉咙的地方是三阴的地方，太阴、少阴、厥阴统统在这个地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-rxu0i22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-rxu0i22","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扁桃腺发炎。一般来说喉咙痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝汤加葛根，可以加一些连翘清热，银花、浮萍、蝉兑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。光是喉咙痛，桂枝三芍药三，葛根用四就可以了。要是还有脸部中风，葛根用六，大剂的。同样一个处方，剂量的多少，运用要存乎一心。一定要知道药性，这样就不会错。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163510-r17jh5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163510-r17jh5d","updated":"20240312163510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茯苓一定可以去补心脏里面水不足的部分。茯苓止热生津除烦的功能。茯苓碰到龙骨牡蛎的时候，就可以让心脏的阳、热回到水里面。如果说心脏里面水不够了，茯苓，然后用龙骨潜阳，龙骨、牡蛎把它固定在里面，所以常常心烦、烦躁的时候，我们用龙骨、牡蛎、茯苓。"}]}]}